"nippy_decode" {:doc "Read trusted Vis Nippy bytes (or their base64 text) back into plain Python data.\n\nVectorz vectors arrive as lists and Clojure's exact types are not preserved.\nRaises TypeError on a non-bytes argument, NippyError on malformed input.\nNever decode bytes from an untrusted source.", :kind "function", :sig "nippy_decode(data)"}

